# Large raw-samples sidecars emitted by the latency_p50_p95_p99 bench
# helper. The .percentiles.jsonl files alongside them are the binding
# evidence; the raw samples are a debugging artifact and exceed jj's
# 1 MiB snapshot ceiling.
evidence/benchmark-logs/*.raw-samples.txt
kani-list.json
/*.rlib
.beads/moon-ci-output.md

# TLA+/TLC generated model-checker state dumps
specs/tla/states/
verification/tla/**/_apalache-out/
vb_oewy_bdd_runner_invariant
